  "notes": "{突然|とつぜん} means 'suddenly' and emphasizes that something happened without warning or expectation.\n\nUSAGE:\n- {突然|とつぜん} + verb: suddenly (adverb)\n- {突然|とつぜん}⟦の→の：09472_no⟧ + noun: sudden ~ (adjective-like)\n- {突然|とつぜん}です⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧...: This may be sudden, but... (polite preface)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{急|きゅう}に→急に：00263_kyuuni⟧: suddenly (neutral, often for changes)\n- ⟦いきなり→いきなり：09379_ikinari⟧: suddenly, abruptly (casual, often implies impoliteness)\n- ⟦ふと→ふと：00048_futo⟧: suddenly, unexpectedly (for thoughts/realizations)\n- ⟦{不意|ふい}に→不意：11351_fui⟧: unexpectedly, by surprise (formal)\n\n{突然|とつぜん} is neutral-formal and works in most contexts. ⟦いきなり→いきなり：09379_ikinari⟧ often suggests something rude or startling.",
